Eduba's code, text, audio recordings and design are shared here so the app
can run at https://eduba.conversations-with-ai.com, and so anyone curious can
see how it was built. You're welcome to read the code and learn from it.

Please don't republish Eduba, or a modified copy of it, as your own app or
website. If you'd like to use part of it for something, just ask:
cwai.eduba@gmail.com

